+Stale file locks are reclaimed only when a same-host owner is proven to have
+exited; foreign-host, live-owner, malformed, and in-progress-recovery locks
+remain in place, and writes fail closed. The managed package deliberately
+removes upstream Git autocommit: `PI_AUTOCOMMIT` and the legacy `.pi-mem.json`
+`autocommit` field are inert. Memory history therefore requires an explicit
+private Git workflow outside Pi Mem, operated manually or by a separate
+external tool.
